    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Debug\r\n\r\nThis sky display should turn gold for a low chance of rain (0–20%), gray for moderate (21–60%), and navy for high (61–100%). \r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nRun the program with a 60% chance of rain. Notice the color doesn’t match what it should. Investigate and fix the logic.",
